          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_Drums could be heard in the distance.</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "OL",
            text: _("<b>_...?</b>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_It didn’t take long for the trolls to understand what was happening.</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 14,
            y: 24,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 9,
            y: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 40,
            y: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 36,
            y: 28,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_Some creatures were about to attack some other creatures. Both creatures’ appearances were strange and monstrous.</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_However, Ougl could feel who was not driven by a good heart.</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "SA",
            text: _("<b>S s a s...! ?</b> (Another enemy!?)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 36,
            y: 28,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_Ougl shook his head in denial.</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "SA",
            text: _("<b>S s a s...?</b> (A friend, then?)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 36,
            y: 28,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_Ougl nodded.</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "AR",
            text: _("<b>Arg-hah!</b> (There is no more hope for you. No matter how many help you, death awaits you anyway.)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "MZ",
            text: _("<b>S y s s...!</b> (Give up your treasures and we will spare you!)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "SA",
            text: _("<b>S s a s...!</b> (Never!)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "NG",
            text: _("<b>Urg-hah!</b> (Then die!)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 19,
            y: 11,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_The Nagini looked again at the trolls.</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "SA",
            text: _("<b>S s a s...?</b> (Will you help us?)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 36,
            y: 28,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_Ougl said only one thing.</i>"),
          },
          {
